e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −6 to +6 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1990","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-washington","name":"Washington","code":"WAS","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 340)","str":88,"squad":[["Mark Rypien","QB",99],["Jeff Rutledge","QB",60],["Earnest Byner","RB",96],["Ricky Ervins","RB",78],["Gary Clark","WR",99],["Art Monk","WR",92],["Ricky Sanders","WR",77],["Stevie Hobbs","WR",56],["Ron Middleton","TE",77],["Terry Orr","TE",73],["Jeff Bostic","OL",99],["Joe Jacoby","OL",99],["Mark Schlereth","OL",99],["Jim Lachey","OL",92],["Raleigh McKenzie","OL",79],["Ed Simmons","OL",60],["Russ Grimm","OL",58],["Charles Mann","DL",94],["Tim Johnson","DL",83],["Eric Williams","DL",81],["Fred Stokes","DL",81],["Markus Koch","DL",69],["Bobby Wilson","DL",68],["Wilber Marshall","LB",92],["Andre Collins","LB",89],["Matt Millen","LB",74],["Darrell Green","CB",89],["Martin Mayhew","CB",85],["Sidney Johnson","CB",67],["A.J. Johnson","CB",64],["Brad Edwards","S",81],["Danny Copeland","S",77],["Alvin Walton","S",60],["Chip Lohmiller","K",97]]},{"id":"nfl-new-orleans-saints","name":"New Orleans Saints","code":"NOS","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 64)","str":85.1,"squad":[["Bobby Hebert","QB",78],["Steve Walsh","QB",78],["Gill Fenerty","RB",90],["Buford Jordan","RB",77],["Eric Martin","WR",84],["Floyd Turner","WR",81],["Quinn Early","WR",81],["Wesley Carroll","WR",70],["Hoby Brenner","TE",87],["John Tice","TE",75],["Ji